 "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [435.843017578125, 499.3544616699219], "pos": [-652.9784545898438, 6660.04443359375], "id": 160, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI-Jjk-Nodes", "ver": "b3c99bb78a99551776b5eab1a820e1cd58f84f31", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [433], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the young adult Chinese woman from <Picture 1>. Preserve her exact facial identity, facial proportions, natural skin texture, long dark-brown hair, half-up hairstyle, loose face-framing strands, earrings, youthful appearance, and gray sleeveless outfit. Use only her identity, appearance, hairstyle, and clothing from <Picture 1>; do not reproduce the bathroom environment.\n<Subject 2> is the athletic sneaker from <Picture 2>. Preserve its exact shape, proportions, cream-colored breathable mesh upper, pale-yellow overlays, orange-yellow side details, cream laces, thick sculpted sole, gold-toned heel structure, orange cushioning detail, material texture, stitching, and tread pattern. Do not redesign, recolor, deform, simplify, or invent a second color variant.\n<Subject 3> is the living-room environment from <Picture 3>, including the black leather sofa, warm floor lamp, dark-framed glass doors, tiled floor, framed wall art, warm sunlight, and quiet residential atmosphere.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] Create a 10-second, 9:16 vertical, photorealistic Chinese social-commerce video. <Subject 1> sits naturally on the black leather sofa in <Subject 3>, holds <Subject 2> toward the camera, and delivers the complete supplied Chinese sales dialogue in one continuous take. The delivery is very fast, enthusiastic, clear, and precisely lip-synchronized.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears throughout [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - preserve the woman's exact facial identity, hairstyle, earrings, gray outfit, natural body proportions, and recognizable appearance from <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> (appears throughout [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - preserve the sneaker's exact cream, pale-yellow, gold, and orange color scheme, silhouette, mesh texture, overlays, laces, sole structure, heel structure, and visible design details from <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 3> (appears throughout [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - retain the black leather sofa, warm floor lamp, dark glass doors, tiled floor, wall decoration, sunlight direction, and warm residential atmosphere from <Picture 3>.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses highly photorealistic smartphone-style social-commerce cinematography. It feels like a genuine personal product recommendation recorded in a comfortable home, with natural skin texture, realistic hands, accurate product proportions, warm daylight, restrained color grading, and subtle handheld movement. The video contains one continuous shot with no cuts so the woman's face, lip synchronization, hands, shoe, and living-room continuity remain stable. No subtitles, captions, prices, logos, watermarks, interface graphics, additional people, duplicated shoes, extra limbs, deformed fingers, beauty-filter skin, or invented product details.\n\n[Shot 1] A vertical medium close-up shows <Subject 1> (S1) sitting upright but relaxed on the black leather sofa in <Subject 3>. The warm floor lamp and dark-framed glass doors remain visible in the background, while natural sunlight creates soft highlights on the leather sofa. She holds <Subject 2> at chest height with both hands, keeping its recognizable outer side facing the camera. Her fingers support the shoe naturally without covering its main mesh panel, orange-yellow side detail, laces, or sculpted heel.\n\nAt 00:00.200, <Subject 1> looks directly into the camera and immediately begins speaking in a very fast, energetic, friendly Chinese sales-presenter cadence. Every word must be pronounced exactly once, in the original order, with no omissions, substitutions, repetitions, added filler words, or paraphrasing. Her mouth movements remain accurately synchronized throughout: <d>[Chinese] 这款鞋子我男朋友每天都穿，用来运动特别舒服，很透气，很有弹性，我太爱这双鞋子了，价格也很便宜！</d>\n\nWhile saying “用来运动特别舒服,” she lifts the shoe slightly closer to the lens. While saying “很透气,” she points briefly and naturally toward the breathable mesh upper without blocking it. While saying “很有弹性,” she gently presses the forefoot and sole once with a small realistic movement; the shoe flexes only slightly and immediately returns to its original form, without rubber-like distortion. While saying “我太爱这双鞋子了,” she brings the shoe beside her face and gives a genuine enthusiastic smile. While saying “价格也很便宜,” she angles the shoe forward into a clean hero position and gives one confident nod.\n\nThe camera performs a very slow, subtle push-in from a medium close-up to a tighter composition, keeping both her complete face and the entire shoe visible. She finishes the final word and closes her lips before 00:09.600. The last 0.4 seconds hold a stable frame of her smiling at the camera with the shoe clearly presented beside her face.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nClean close-recorded Chinese dialogue remains dominant throughout. Add only subtle living-room ambience, faint fabric movement, and quiet hand contact with the shoe. No echo, crowd noise, outdoor traffic, or competing sound effects.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [435.843017578125, 499.3544616699219], "pos": [-643.2760009765625, 6112.41845703125], "id": 206, "properties":